  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving food security of households affected by El Nino-induced drought in Manica  Sofala provinc</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will work with the District Agricultural Services (SDAE) in each of the districts, the NGOs operating in the district and the community-based organizations (FFS groups, farmers associations and others with the ultimate objective of empowering local institutions, actors and communities to take the ownership of the project activities leading to a long-term sustainability.</narrative>
